\Big(I - \Big( \sum_{b,b'} 1_{\alpha b + \beta b' = \alpha g_\xpt(x) + \beta g_\zpt(z)} \, \hat{M}^{(\Point, Z),z}_{b'} \hat{M}^{(\Point, X), x}_{b} \Big)_{\bob \alice''} \Big)\ket{\hat{\psi}} }^2 } \\
          \leq& 1 \cdot \sqrt{\delta_Q}.
